# Config and content IDs

- Prefer stable lowercase namespaced ids in config (`unit.commander`, `terrain.grass`).
- Research: `TechnologyId` constant names must match the current catalog id (PascalCase of the last kebab segment). Do not leave aliases like `LightBot` pointing at `ground-unit-attack`. See `.cursor/rules/research-ids.mdc`.
- Runtime loads `game.json` / `research.json` / `tiles.json` / `entities.json` (Core parse, Client I/O). New recipes/combat/build costs still go into `MvpDefinitions.cs` until those domains migrate — not SFML.
- Do not hardcode recipes/balance in rendering code.
- Asset paths are presentation-only and must not define gameplay rules.
- Document transitional hardcoded values in `docs/MVP_IMPLEMENTATION_DECISIONS.md` when they change product behavior.
